{"version":1,"content":"<p>瑞士科學家發現，當地穀倉貓頭鷹正在經歷一種引人關注的變化。在過去30年間，這些夜行性猛禽的羽毛顏色逐漸變得更加偏紅褐色，同時身上的黑色斑點數量和面積也明顯增加。研究人員通過分析超過3000隻個體的基因組數據，確認這一現象並非隨機波動，而是自然選擇正在發揮作用的結果。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1584260.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T06:21:08.723798+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T06:02:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T06:18:11.383759+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T06:18:11.383759+00:00","content_hash":"f9fc2f504c0a939db9c30f9dc0cee509ab2e85ebfe325c6de6f02056067b648e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}